      "uid": "zhcn:b1b7db0f40a6d17612c876df",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而现在也是。高兴地讲述自己抵达终点一事的双涡轮，\n无论何时都会让我的心情变得开朗。",
      "source_fingerprint": "04e5a078abc18a0686c7479bb3d5f4d43fcf88997e7da6a2ccff5b10acfa5731",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
